            <ArticleTitle>The hip or not.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1398-400</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pathologies within the ileopsoas compartment can present as hip pain and as such can be mistaken for diseases of the hip joint. Radiological investigations are useful in helping to differentiate between these pathologies.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
